/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256838559/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1623512398","hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1203710/376578/d1c47f43f8b62ed537bc19f325ca227869a26ba6/1751203596/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1623512398","mp4":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steam/apps/256838559/movie480.mp4"}],"genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie"],"features":["Single-player","Steam Achievements","Steam Cloud","Steam Trading Cards","Family Sharing"],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"controller":"full","dev":["@unepic_fran"],"pub":["Versus Evil","tinyBuild"],"released":"Sep 28, 2021","meta":82,"langs":["English","Spanish - Spain","Italian","Russian","French","German","Portuguese - Brazil","Japanese","Korean","Simplified Chinese","Arabic"],"min":[["OS","Windows 7"],["Processor","Intel i3"],["Memory","4 GB RAM"],["Graphics","256Mb openGL"],["DirectX","Version 9.0"],["Storage","400 MB available space"],["Sound Card","Direct Sound"]],"rec":[],"deck":3,"blurb":"Classic stealth games get a humorous tribute in this 2D stealth action-adventure. You play Jesse Fox, held at a secret military facility for a crime he did not commit, who must escape using improvised gadgets, quick talking, explosives and, if needed, his fists. Taking down enemies quietly earns experience and skills, and you uncover a hidden plot as you work your way out.\n\nAt points, Jesse is interrogated by a lieutenant and recounts how the escape went, which feeds the comedy. UnMetal's tone is irreverent, with absurd moments such as impersonating a cat. Single-player with full controller support, it suits fans of old-school stealth action who like jokes with their infiltration."}}